<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>PathKeeper | Opportunity Atlas</title>

<style>

/* =========================================================
   PATHKEEPER OPPORTUNITY ATLAS
   GOOGLE SITES FRIENDLY VERSION
   ========================================================= */

*{
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth;
}

body{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
    background:#f4efe4;
    color:#26352b;
    line-height:1.6;
}

a{
    color:inherit;
    text-decoration:none;
}

img{
    max-width:100%;
}

/* =========================================================
   COLORS
   ========================================================= */

:root{
    --green:#245238;
    --green-dark:#173a28;
    --green-light:#dfe9df;
    --brown:#68452d;
    --brown-dark:#40291d;
    --brown-light:#eadccc;
    --cream:#f4efe4;
    --paper:#fffdf8;
    --gold:#a87932;
    --text:#26352b;
    --muted:#687168;
    --line:#d8ccba;
    --white:#ffffff;
}

/* =========================================================
   MAIN WRAPPER
   ========================================================= */

.page{
    width:100%;
    overflow:hidden;
}

/* =========================================================
   HERO
   ========================================================= */

.hero{
    background:#173a28;
    color:#ffffff;
    padding:55px 20px 60px;
}

.hero-inner{
    width:100%;
    max-width:1150px;
    margin:0 auto;
}

.hero-label{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#a87932;
    color:#ffffff;
    padding:7px 12px;
    border-radius:4px;
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:1.5px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.hero h1{
    margin:0 0 20px;
    font-size:clamp(38px,7vw,76px);
    line-height:1;
    letter-spacing:-2px;
}

.hero h1 span{
    color:#d9b878;
}

.hero-text{
    max-width:780px;
    font-size:18px;
    color:#e1e8e2;
    margin:0 0 30px;
}

.hero-buttons{
    margin-top:20px;
}

.hero-button{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#d2ad68;
    color:#173a28;
    padding:13px 18px;
    border-radius:5px;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin:5px 5px 5px 0;
}

.hero-button.alt{
    background:transparent;
    border:1px solid #8da393;
    color:#ffffff;
}

/* =========================================================
   HERO PATH
   ========================================================= */

.hero-path{
    margin-top:40px;
    background:#214a34;
    border:1px solid #3c654c;
    padding:20px;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.hero-path-title{
    color:#d8b56f;
    font-size:11px;
    letter-spacing:1.5px;
    font-weight:bold;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.path-item{
    display:inline-block;
    width:auto;
    margin:4px 3px;
    background:#173a28;
    border:1px solid #476954;
    padding:9px 12px;
    border-radius:4px;
    font-size:12px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

/* =========================================================
   GENERAL SECTION
   ========================================================= */

.section{
    padding:65px 20px;
}

.section-inner{
    width:100%;
    max-width:1150px;
    margin:0 auto;
}

.section.green{
    background:#245238;
    color:#ffffff;
}

.section.brown{
    background:#68452d;
    color:#ffffff;
}

.section.cream{
    background:#f4efe4;
}

.section.paper{
    background:#fffdf8;
}

.section.soft-green{
    background:#dfe9df;
}

.section.soft-brown{
    background:#eadccc;
}

.section-heading{
    max-width:800px;
    margin-bottom:35px;
}

.section-number{
    color:#a87932;
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:2px;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.section.green .section-number,
.section.brown .section-number{
    color:#dfbd79;
}

.section-heading h2{
    margin:0 0 15px;
    font-size:clamp(30px,5vw,52px);
    line-height:1.05;
    letter-spacing:-1px;
}

.section-heading p{
    margin:0;
    color:#687168;
    font-size:16px;
}

.section.green .section-heading p,
.section.brown .section-heading p{
    color:#d9e3dc;
}

/* =========================================================
   STARTING POINT CARDS
   ========================================================= */

.card-row{
    width:100%;
    font-size:0;
}

.card{
    display:inline-block;
    vertical-align:top;
    width:31.8%;
    margin:0 1.4% 18px 0;
    background:#ffffff;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
    border-radius:7px;
    padding:24px;
    font-size:14px;
}

.card:nth-child(3n){
    margin-right:0;
}

.card-icon{
    width:40px;
    height:40px;
    border-radius:50%;
    background:#dfe9df;
    color:#245238;
    display:block;
    text-align:center;
    line-height:40px;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.card h3{
    color:#40291d;
    margin:0 0 8px;
    font-size:19px;
}

.card p{
    color:#687168;
    font-size:13px;
    margin:0 0 15px;
}

.card-question{
    color:#245238;
    border-top:1px solid #eee7dc;
    padding-top:12px;
    font-size:11px;
    font-weight:bold;
    text-transform:uppercase;
    letter-spacing:.5px;
}

/* =========================================================
   OPPORTUNITY LADDER
   ========================================================= */

.ladder{
    width:100%;
}

.ladder-step{
    display:inline-block;
    vertical-align:top;
    width:15.8%;
    min-height:250px;
    margin:0 1% 15px 0;
    padding:20px 16px;
    background:#fffdf8;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
    border-top:5px solid #245238;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.ladder-step:last-child{
    margin-right:0;
}

.ladder-number{
    color:#a87932;
    font-weight:bold;
    font-size:12px;
}

.ladder-step h3{
    color:#40291d;
    font-size:17px;
    line-height:1.2;
    margin:15px 0 10px;
}

.ladder-step p{
    color:#687168;
    font-size:12px;
    margin:0;
}

/* =========================================================
   OPPORTUNITY CATEGORIES
   ========================================================= */

.category{
    width:100%;
    margin-bottom:22px;
    background:#ffffff;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
    border-radius:7px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.category-header{
    background:#245238;
    color:#ffffff;
    padding:18px 22px;
}

.category-header h3{
    margin:0;
    font-size:23px;
}

.category-header p{
    margin:4px 0 0;
    color:#d8e3da;
    font-size:13px;
}

.category-body{
    padding:20px;
}

/* =========================================================
   OPPORTUNITY TAGS
   ========================================================= */

.opportunity{
    display:inline-block;
    vertical-align:top;
    width:23.5%;
    margin:0 1.4% 12px 0;
    padding:15px;
    min-height:105px;
    background:#f4efe4;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.opportunity:nth-child(4n){
    margin-right:0;
}

.opportunity strong{
    display:block;
    color:#40291d;
    font-size:14px;
    margin-bottom:5px;
}

.opportunity span{
    display:block;
    color:#687168;
    font-size:11px;
}

/* =========================================================
   DECISION FRAMEWORK
   ========================================================= */

.decision-table{
    width:100%;
    border-collapse:collapse;
    background:#ffffff;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
}

.decision-table th{
    background:#68452d;
    color:#ffffff;
    text-align:left;
    padding:15px;
    font-size:13px;
}

.decision-table td{
    border-top:1px solid #e1d8ca;
    padding:15px;
    font-size:13px;
    color:#4d5b51;
    vertical-align:top;
}

.decision-table tr:nth-child(even){
    background:#faf7f0;
}

.decision-table td:first-child{
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#245238;
}

/* =========================================================
   EVIDENCE
   ========================================================= */

.evidence-box{
    display:inline-block;
    vertical-align:top;
    width:48.7%;
    margin-right:2%;
    background:#ffffff;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
    padding:25px;
    border-radius:7px;
}

.evidence-box:last-child{
    margin-right:0;
}

.evidence-box h3{
    margin:0 0 15px;
    color:#40291d;
    font-size:21px;
}

.evidence-list{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    list-style:none;
}

.evidence-list li{
    padding:9px 0;
    border-bottom:1px solid #eee7dc;
    font-size:13px;
    color:#59655c;
}

.evidence-list li:before{
    content:"✓";
    color:#245238;
    font-weight:bold;
    margin-right:8px;
}

/* =========================================================
   OPPORTUNITY SOURCES
   ========================================================= */

.source-box{
    background:#fffdf8;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
    border-left:6px solid #68452d;
    padding:24px;
    margin-bottom:15px;
    border-radius:4px;
}

.source-box h3{
    margin:0 0 6px;
    color:#40291d;
    font-size:19px;
}

.source-box p{
    color:#687168;
    font-size:13px;
    margin:0 0 10px;
}

.source-type{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#dfe9df;
    color:#245238;
    padding:5px 8px;
    border-radius:3px;
    font-size:9px;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:.8px;
}

/* =========================================================
   SEARCH SYSTEM
   ========================================================= */

.search-panel{
    background:#173a28;
    color:#ffffff;
    padding:35px;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.search-panel h2{
    margin:0 0 10px;
    font-size:32px;
}

.search-panel p{
    color:#d4dfd7;
    font-size:14px;
    max-width:750px;
}

.search-rule{
    background:#245238;
    border:1px solid #456850;
    padding:18px;
    margin-top:20px;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.search-rule strong{
    color:#dfbd79;
}

.search-steps{
    margin-top:25px;
}

.search-step{
    display:inline-block;
    vertical-align:top;
    width:18.4%;
    margin-right:1.7%;
    background:#ffffff;
    color:#26352b;
    padding:17px;
    min-height:130px;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.search-step:last-child{
    margin-right:0;
}

.search-step b{
    color:#a87932;
    display:block;
    font-size:11px;
    margin-bottom:8px;
}

.search-step strong{
    color:#40291d;
    display:block;
    margin-bottom:7px;
}

.search-step span{
    color:#687168;
    font-size:11px;
}

/* =========================================================
   WEEKLY SYSTEM
   ========================================================= */

.week{
    display:inline-block;
    vertical-align:top;
    width:18.4%;
    margin-right:1.7%;
    background:#ffffff;
    border:1px solid #d8ccba;
    padding:20px;
    min-height:185px;
    border-radius:5px;
}

.week:last-child{
    margin-right:0;
}

.week-day{
    color:#a87932;
    font-size:10px;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:1px;
}

.week h3{
    color:#40291d;
    font-size:18px;
    margin:10px 0 8px;
}

.week p{
    color:#687168;
    font-size:12px;
    margin:0;
}

/* =========================================================
   PRINCIPLE
   ========================================================= */

.principle{
    text-align:center;
    max-width:850px;
    margin:0 auto;
}

.principle h2{
    margin:0 0 20px;
    font-size:clamp(34px,6vw,64px);
    line-height:1;
    letter-spacing:-1.5px;
}

.principle p{
    font-size:17px;
    color:#dce6df;
}

.principle-rule{
    margin-top:25px;
    padding:15px;
    border-top:1px solid #587361;
    border-bottom:1px solid #587361;
    color:#dfbd79;
    font-weight:bold;
    font-size:13px;
    letter-spacing:.7px;
}

/* =========================================================
   FOOTER
   ========================================================= */

.footer{
    background:#40291d;
    color:#ffffff;
    padding:35px 20px;
}

.footer-inner{
    max-width:1150px;
    margin:0 auto;
}

.footer-title{
    color:#dfbd79;
    font-size:13px;
    font-weight:bold;
    letter-spacing:1px;
}

.footer p{
    margin:7px 0 0;
    color:#cbbeb3;
    font-size:11px;
}

/* =========================================================
   RESPONSIVE
   ========================================================= */

/*
   These rules are intentionally simple.
   Google Sites sometimes gives embedded content a narrow width.
*/

@media(max-width:900px){

    .card{
        width:48.5%;
        margin-right:3%;
    }

    .card:nth-child(3n){
        margin-right:3%;
    }

    .card:nth-child(2n){
        margin-right:0;
    }

    .ladder-step{
        width:31.8%;
        margin-right:1.5%;
    }

    .ladder-step:nth-child(3n){
        margin-right:0;
    }

    .opportunity{
        width:48%;
        margin-right:3%;
    }

    .opportunity:nth-child(4n){
        margin-right:3%;
    }

    .opportunity:nth-child(2n){
        margin-right:0;
    }

    .search-step{
        width:31%;
        margin-right:2.5%;
        margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .search-step:nth-child(3n){
        margin-right:0;
    }

    .week{
        width:31%;
        margin-right:2.5%;
        margin-bottom:12px;
    }

    .week:nth-child(3n){
        margin-right:0;
    }
}

@media(max-width:600px){

    .hero{
        padding:42px 15px 45px;
    }

    .section{
        padding:45px 15px;
    }

    .card{
        width:100%;
        margin-right:0 !important;
    }

    .ladder-step{
        width:100%;
        margin-right:0 !important;
        min-height:auto;
    }

    .opportunity{
        width:100%;
        margin-right:0 !important;
    }

    .evidence-box{
        width:100%;
        margin-right:0;
        margin-bottom:15px;
    }

    .search-step{
        width:100%;
        margin-right:0;
        margin-bottom:12px;
        min-height:auto;
    }

    .week{
        width:100%;
        margin-right:0;
        min-height:auto;
    }

    .decision-table{
        font-size:11px;
    }

    .decision-table th,
    .decision-table td{
        padding:10px;
    }

    .search-panel{
        padding:23px;
    }

}

</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="page">

<!-- ======================================================
     HERO
====================================================== -->

<section class="hero">

<div class="hero-inner">

<div class="hero-label">
PathKeeper / Opportunity Atlas
</div>

<h1>
Find a better path.<br>
<span>Keep finding better ones.</span>
</h1>

<p class="hero-text">
The Opportunity Atlas is designed for people who don't want their
future to depend on one job application, one degree, one employer,
or one lucky break. Learn how to identify opportunities, compare
pathways, build evidence, and continuously search for better options.
</p>

<div class="hero-buttons">

<a href="#starting-point" class="hero-button">
START WITH YOUR SITUATION
</a>

<a href="#opportunities" class="hero-button alt">
EXPLORE OPPORTUNITIES
</a>

</div>


<div class="hero-path">

<div class="hero-path-title">
The Opportunity Loop
</div>

<div class="path-item">IDENTIFY</div>
<div class="path-item">SEARCH</div>
<div class="path-item">COMPARE</div>
<div class="path-item">PREPARE</div>
<div class="path-item">APPLY</div>
<div class="path-item">LEARN</div>
<div class="path-item">SEARCH AGAIN</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- ======================================================
     SECTION 1
====================================================== -->

<section class="section cream" id="starting-point">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-heading">

<div class="section-number">
01 / STARTING POINT
</div>

<h2>
Don't start with the opportunity. Start with the problem.
</h2>

<p>
The right opportunity depends on what you are actually trying to
change. Identify the constraint first, then search for solutions.
</p>

</div>


<div class="card-row">

<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">1</div>

<h3>I Need Income</h3>

<p>
Look for employment, paid training, apprenticeships, contract work,
freelancing, and other routes that can create income while building
future earning power.
</p>

<div class="card-question">
Primary question: How quickly can this create income?
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">2</div>

<h3>I Need Skills</h3>

<p>
Find free courses, employer training, apprenticeships, projects,
labs, simulations, and structured practice.
</p>

<div class="card-question">
Primary question: What skill will create future options?
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">3</div>

<h3>I Need Experience</h3>

<p>
Search for internships, apprenticeships, volunteer work, freelance
projects, competitions, and real-world project opportunities.
</p>

<div class="card-question">
Primary question: Where can I prove I can do the work?
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">4</div>

<h3>I Need a Credential</h3>

<p>
Investigate certifications, licenses, degrees, certificates,
badges, and employer-recognized training.
</p>

<div class="card-question">
Primary question: Which credential is actually valued?
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">5</div>

<h3>I Need Funding</h3>

<p>
Search scholarships, grants, stipends, fellowships, competitions,
tuition assistance, and employer-paid programs.
</p>

<div class="card-question">
Primary question: Who will pay for the next step?
</div>

</div>


<div class="card">

<div class="card-icon">6</div>

<h3>I Need Mobility</h3>

<p>
Investigate relocation programs, remote work, international
opportunities, talent programs, and geographic alternatives.
</p>

<div class="card-question">
Primary question: Can changing location change my options?
</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- ======================================================
     SECTION 2
====================================================== -->

<section class="section soft-brown">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-heading">

<div class="section-number">
02 / OPPORTUNITY LADDER
</div>

<h2>
You don't always need a breakthrough. You need a sequence.
</h2>

<p>
Use smaller opportunities to create evidence that qualifies you
for larger opportunities.
</p>

</div>


<div class="ladder">

<div class="ladder-step">

<div class="ladder-number">01</div>

<h3>Current Position</h3>

<p>
Inventory your education, skills, experience, money, location,
network, tools, and constraints.
</p>

</div>


<div class="ladder-step">

<div class="ladder-number">02</div>

<h3>Build Evidence</h3>

<p>
Create projects, work samples, portfolios, demonstrations,
case studies, and documented results.
</p>

</div>


<div class="ladder-step">

<div class="ladder-number">03</div>

<h3>Get Experience</h3>

<p>
Use work, apprenticeships, internships, volunteering,
freelancing, or projects to gain practical experience.
</p>

</div>


<div class="ladder-step">

<div class="ladder-number">04</div>

<h3>Add Credentials</h3>

<p>
Add targeted qualifications when they increase your credibility
or unlock opportunities.
</p>

</div>


<div class="ladder-step">

<div class="ladder-number">05</div>

<h3>Compete Higher</h3>

<p>
Use your accumulated evidence to pursue better employers,
programs, contracts, funding, or education.
</p>

</div>


<div class="ladder-step">

<div class="ladder-number">06</div>

<h3>Create Leverage</h3>

<p>
Skills, experience, reputation, relationships, and money can
begin producing opportunities instead of only requiring you to
search for them.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


<!-- ======================================================
     OPPORTUNITY ATLAS
====================================================== -->

<section class="section paper" id="opportunities">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="section-heading">

<div class="section-number">
03 / OPPORTUNITY ATLAS
</div>

<h2>
Search across the entire opportunity ecosystem.
</h2>

<p>
A job is only one kind of opportunity. Explore the mechanisms that
can improve education, income, skills, experience, funding, mobility,
and independence.
</p>

</div>


<!-- EDUCATION -->

<div class="category">

<div class="category-header">

<h3>Education & Learning</h3>

<p>
Ways to learn without assuming there is only one educational route.
</p>

</div>

<div class="category-body">

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Community Colleges</strong>
<span>Lower-cost pathways into degrees, certificates, and technical programs.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Online Courses</strong>
<span>Learn specific skills without committing to a full program.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Open Courseware</strong>
<span>University-level educational material available for independent learning.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Trade Schools</strong>
<span>Career-focused training for skilled occupations.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Bootcamps</strong>
<span>Intensive training focused on specific career skills.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Employer Training</strong>
<span>Companies sometimes train workers for specialized positions.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Continuing Education</strong>
<span>Shorter programs designed around specific professional skills.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Self-Education</strong>
<span>Independent learning supported by projects and measurable evidence.</span>
</div>

</div>

</div>


<!-- WORK -->

<div class="category">

<div class="category-header">

<h3>Employment & Work</h3>

<p>
Ways to turn skills and effort into income and professional experience.
</p>

</div>

<div class="category-body">

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Entry-Level Jobs</strong>
<span>Starting positions where employers train or supervise developing workers.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Apprenticeships</strong>
<span>Earn experience while learning through structured work.</span>
</div>

<div class="opportunity">
<strong>Internships</strong>
<span>Gain workplace experience before competing for higher-level roles.</span>
</div>

