<!-- ======================================================
     SEARCH SYSTEM
====================================================== -->

<section class="section green">

<div class="section-inner">

<div class="search-panel">

<h2>
The opportunity search system
</h2>

<p>
Instead of searching randomly, run the same process every time.
This turns opportunity discovery into a repeatable skill.
</p>


<div class="search-rule">

<strong>Important:</strong>
Don't search only for the job you want.
Search for the requirements, experiences, funding, training,
people, organizations, and adjacent pathways that can lead to it.

</div>


<div class="search-steps">

<div class="search-step">

<b>01</b>

<strong>Define</strong>

<span>
Write the outcome you want.
</span>

</div>


<div class="search-step">

<b>02</b>

<strong>Expand</strong>

<span>
Find multiple ways to reach that outcome.
</span>

</div>


<div class="search-step">

<b>03</b>

<strong>Filter</strong>

<span>
Remove options that don't fit your constraints.
</span>

</div>


<div class="search-step">

<b>04</b>

<strong>Prepare</strong>

<span>
Build the evidence and requirements.
</span>

</div>


<div class="search-step">

<b>05</b>

<strong>Act</strong>

<span>
Apply, contact, build, test, or participate.
</span>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

</section>


