PATHKEEPER PRINCIPLE
</div>

<h2>
Your future shouldn't depend on finding one perfect opportunity.
</h2>

<p>
Build a system that continuously discovers possibilities,
evaluates them against your reality, develops the evidence you need,
and keeps moving toward better options.
</p>

<div class="principle-rule">
IDENTIFY → SEARCH → FILTER → PREPARE → APPLY → LEARN → SEARCH AGAIN
</div>

